# Elrond, Moon-Reader: "Whenever you activate an ability of a creature, draw a card." An ability that uses the stack counts too: on turn 5 Bot1 taps Jace,
# Vryn's Prodigy to loot, and Elrond's trigger draws one card as well, so the library falls by two (18 to 16 once both resolve). Bot2's own
# Llanowar Elves, a creature's ability on turn 4, does not trigger Bot1's Elrond: the library stays at 19 (the ? line). Bot1's draw step already took one on turn 5.

